	(text "Front light: 6-pin 0.5 mm flex, 1-2 anode, 3-4 NC, 5-6 cathode (GDEY029T94-FL03: 4 LEDs, Vf 2.8 V typ, 60 mA max; Orient AEZ122250A00: 3 LEDs, 45 mA at 3.3 V).\nDriven from the carrier (Q4 + 15R clamp, ~45 mA) over cable pins 9/10. Two ZIF positions, fit ONE: J3 FL-A for a tail leaving at the glass corner (FL03), J4 FL-B for a tail running beside the display tail on its pin-24 side (Orient; its pin numbers run opposite, so 1-2 = cathode).\nR1/R2 (fit) pass FL_P->FL_A, FL_N->FL_K; R3/R5 (DNP) cross them over for a tail whose polarity turns out mirrored."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 262 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0bcd52b8-008a-5ebc-a9b3-3f69c2886b4e")
	)
	(text "The brief's 10 uH / 3-4.7 R values were placeholders; the GDEY029T94 sheet specifies 47 uH 500 mA and 2.2 R. Verify against the sheet for the exact panel ordered."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220 250 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "27fe001d-bcd3-52cb-bb79-b4616b61eed6")
	)
	(text "Layout: L1-Q5-R4-GND and L1-D3-C3-GND loops under 10 mm; RESE a short guarded trace; the 25 V caps in a row behind J1 pins 18-24; ground pour under the cluster."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220 245 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6e7db064-47ac-5987-b186-009b00dda384")
	)
	(text "Boost: 3V3_EPD -> L1 -> SW node; Q5 (gate GDR) switches SW to GND through R4 (RESE sense). D3 SW->VGH into C3. C5 flies SW->PUMP; D2 clamps PUMP to GND (anode PUMP); D1 pumps PUMP into VGL (anode VGL) with C4."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "74165afb-43eb-51e6-ba35-7398b0af2e1b")
	)
	(text "TSCL/TSDA (6/7) open: internal temperature sensor. BS1 (8) low: 4-wire SPI. VPP (19) open, OTP only. VDD (18) is the internal 1.8 V LDO output, cap only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 175 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b66d1d17-c885-57d8-9396-feae600380d1")
	)
	(text "Panel board for 24-pin 0.5 mm SSD1680/SSD1681 e-paper (Good Display GDEY029T94 2.9\" 296x128, Orient AEZ122250A00 2.13\" 122x250, ...). Reference circuit identical in both sheets: RESE 2.2R, L 47uH, MBR0530 x3, 25 V caps, BS1 low (4-wire SPI)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c44d308f-e1cd-5881-a960-7ee68d1838ce")
	)
